---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
pageScripts:
  - /assets/js/mascot.js
---
{% from "nomination-callout.njk" import nominationCallout %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__inner">
    <div class="hero__brand">
      <img src="/assets/icons/hof-logo.png" alt="{{ site.title }}" class="hero__crest">
      <div>
        <div class="hero__wordmark">Smithville<br>All-Sports<br>Hall of Fame</div>
        <div class="hero__est">Est. {{ site.establishedYear }} · {{ inductees.length }} inductees</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="hero__sub">Honoring individuals who have excelled in athletics, provide scholarships for deserving senior student-athletes, promote school and community pride, and preserve the rich athletic history and traditions of Green Local Schools.</p>
    <a href="/inductees/" class="btn btn--gold">Browse all inductees</a>
  </div>
  {% include "mascot-widget.njk" %}
</section>

{{ nominationCallout("Know someone who belongs here?", "Tell us who they are, when they played, and what they did — a few sentences is enough to start.", "Open the nomination form", site.nominateUrl) }}

<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <h2>About the Hall of Fame</h2>
  <p>Founded in {{ site.establishedYear }} to recognize the athletes, coaches, teams and contributors who shaped Smithville athletics. Inductions are held every other year at a banquet, where each inductee speaks briefly and receives a plaque that hangs in the school.</p>

  <h3>Senior scholarships</h3>
  <p>Alongside honoring the past, the committee awards scholarships each spring to graduating Smithville senior student-athletes — {{ scholarships.totalRecipients }} of them since {{ scholarships.firstYear }}, funded by the Senior Scholarship Fund.</p>
  <a href="/scholarships/" class="btn btn--gold">See scholarship recipients</a>

  <h3>Support the Hall of Fame</h3>
  <p>We invite you to partner with us in supporting these important efforts by becoming one of our sponsors. Sponsors may choose to support either the general operating fund of the organization or our Senior Scholarship Fund.</p>
  <p>Thank you for your continued support of the SHS All Sports Hall of Fame Committee and the student-athletes of Green Local Schools.</p>
  <a href="{{ site.contributionFormUrl }}" class="btn btn--green">Open the contribution form</a>

  <h3>The committee</h3>
  <div class="committee-grid">
    {% for c in committee %}
    <div class="committee-card">
      <div class="committee-card__name">{{ c.name }}</div>
      <div class="committee-card__role">{{ c.role }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
